                "description": "Emtek's Tubular Ares Handleset features a two piece design in which the deadbolt portion is separated from the grip and thumb-press for a classic look that works beautifully on transitional decor. The Ares Single Cylinder Entry Door Handleset has some modern design elements, but it also leans heavily on the classic beauty of traditional styles, allowing this front door lock to look at home on your home's front door. This entrance set is actually available in either a dummy or a single cylinder function. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. Choose from several popular finishes and a huge selection of interior trim levers and knobs.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Emtek Ares Entrance Handlesets, Ares Tubular Handlesets, Ares Single Cylinder Entry Door Handlesets, Ares Entry Door Handlesets, Ares Two Piece Handlesets, Emtek 4817, Emtek 4807, modern handlesets, contemporary handlesets, front door handles, front door locks, entry door handlesets with deadbolts, front door handle replacements, modern front door handles"
